{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國商務部和司法部當地時間11月16日罕見聯合發佈聲明，公佈了針對新加坡雲計算企業Megaspeed的調查進展。這項調查涉及該公司涉嫌將受到美國出口管制的先進半導體轉運至中國，規避美國對華AI晶片出口限制。兩部門表示，調查始於2024年，目前已由司法部主導刑事調查，並將依法追究可能存在的違法行為。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586782.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:18.014152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:28:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:26.635115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:26.635115+00:00","content_hash":"92a5ba7c0d1837c861f44423315910a35b1e64a21f2a13f33d6e6e5a9f5a434b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}